<title>MACEDONIA: Macedonia forex reserves fell to $250.6 mln in Feb.</title>
<headline>Macedonia forex reserves fell to $250.6 mln in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>SKOPJE 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Macedonia (NBM) said on Thursday foreign exchange reserves fell to $250.6 million in February from $254 million in January. The NBM gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-84561</p>
</text>
